# Qwen3.8-27B served locally by llama.cpp, or on a cloud GPU via spinloop cloud.
# ALIAS names the model in opencode and selects the preset section below.
PROVIDER llamacpp
ALIAS    qwen3.8-27b
CONTEXT  32768            # match the server's --ctx-size; raise it on a bigger box
PRESET   ./preset.ini     # `spinloop serve` launches llama-server from this
# BASEURL http://127.0.0.1:9090/v1   # uncomment for a non-default host/port
